Z||000000||Motorhead||06-02-99||02:53 PM||||Thanks go out to HOCK and RACER 1.<p>The demise of my clutch release bearing forces me to drop the engine and transaxle this week, and also forces me to park the car a little while. Good time to get that header on and work on rear suspension.<p>Thanks for rekindeling interest HOCK, and thanks RACER 1 for mentioning SUMMIT! I've got their catalogs all over the house but didn't see a listing for the engine, so I never called them.  <p>I called them today and checked, and sure enough, they can order them for delivery in about three weeks.<p>You could never build them for $270 !<p>Thanks again for all the help ya'll. 
